Acknowledgements 


would like to thank those authors and researchers who have come before 

me, such as Dudley Pope, Stephen Talty and Terry Breverton, but I would 
mostly like to thank the people at British History Online, who have placed a 
huge number of historical documents online for everyone to access. Without 
